OL,3,AUS has floated Ukraine ceding Donbas
OL,4,Afor Nato membership, Zelensky says
OL,5,
OL,6,FUS negotiators have touted the idea of
OL,7,FUkraine withdrawing its remaining
OL,8,Fforces from the eastern Donbas region
OL,9,Fin exchange for Nato membership,
OL,10,FVolodymyr Zelensky has said.
OL,12,FThe Ukrainian president's comments come
OL,13,Fafter US President Donald Trump's
OL,14,Fenvoys met Russian President Vladimir
OL,15,FPutin and Zelensky as part of US
OL,16,Fefforts to end the war between Russia
OL,17,Fand Ukraine.
OL,23,APub: 14-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
