OL,3,AUS has floated Ukraine ceding Donbas
OL,4,Afor Nato membership, Zelensky says
OL,5,
OL,6,FKyiv has long sought membership of the
OL,7,Fmilitary alliance, but this has
OL,8,Fpreviously been opposed by the US and
OL,9,Fothers while Russia has said another
OL,10,FNato member on its border is
OL,11,Funacceptable.
OL,13,FRussia controls most of the industrial
OL,14,Fregion of Donbas and Zelensky has
OL,15,Fconsistently said Ukraine is unwilling
OL,16,Fto give up sovereign territory.
